, 'description': ['An optimization algorithm used in the ViCo method.', 'An optimization algorithm used for training ViCo embeddings.', 'An optimization algorithm reported to work best for GloVe.', 'An optimization algorithm used in the ViCo method.', 'An optimization algorithm used in the ViCo method.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 4, 5, 6, 8]}, 'Object-Hypernym co-occurrences': {'type': ['method', 'method', 'method'], 'description': ['A type of visual co-occurrence calculated using ImageNet annotations augmented with WordNet hypernyms, representing the relationship between objects and their broader categories.', 'A type of visual co-occurrence computed using ImageNet annotations augmented with WordNet hypernyms.', 'A type of visual co-occurrence extracted from ImageNet annotations augmented with WordNet hypernyms.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 0, 0]}, 'Object-Attribute co-occurrences': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ["A type of visual co-occurrence computed from VisualGenome's object and attribute annotations.", "A type of visual co-occurrence computed from VisualGenome's object and attribute annotations."], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 0]}, 'Four types of visual co-occurrences': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The collective set of visual co-occurrences extracted from the datasets. The specific types are not explicitly named in this text unit, but the context implies their existence.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Unsupervised Clustering': {'type': ['task', 'task', 'task'], 'description': ["An evaluation setting used to assess ViCo's ability to capture similarities and differences between visual concepts.", "An unsupervised machine learning task used to evaluate ViCo's ability to capture similarities and differences between visual concepts.", "An evaluation task used to assess the performance of ViCo, where the method's ability to group similar words together without explicit labels is tested."], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 1, 2]}, 'Supervised Parti